#. とりあえず…この現場で気になった所は、
#. 一通り調べ終わったかな…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I think I've checked everything I need to in this\n"
"area."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、まだ終わりじゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I'm not done yet...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この現場以外にも、
#. 調べなきゃいけない場所があるはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are other areas I need to check.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さっき見つけた破片…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Specifically, that fragment I found before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この破片の正体を調べる為に、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>あの場所<CLT><CLT 4>に行かなきゃいけないし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's <CLT><CLT 3>somewhere<CLT><CLT 4> I need to go in order to confirm\n"
"my suspicions...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、霧切さんに関する情報を
#. もっと集めないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And I still need to find out more about Kyoko.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの死体は本当に霧切さんなのか…？
#. だとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that corpse really Kyoko? If that's true...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>昨日の夜、ボクを襲ったのも、
#. 霧切さんだったのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...was that also Kyoko who attacked me last night?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その答え…もっと霧切さんの事を知れば、
#. 見えてくるかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I can find out more about her, maybe I can answer\n"
"that question...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつも、自分の事は何も話してくれない
#. 霧切さんだったけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko was never the kind of person to talk about\n"
"herself all that much.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>霧切さんの部屋<CLT><CLT 4>に行ければ…
#. もう少し、彼女の事がわかるはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe if I can get into <CLT><CLT 3>her room<CLT><CLT 4>, I'll be able to\n"
"find out more...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、彼女の部屋の鍵は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the key to her room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お前の行動を制限させてもらうだけだ。
#. これ以上、怪しい行動を取れないようにな…
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I will simply...limit your options. I can't allow you\n"
"to engage in any further suspicious activity."
msgstr ""

#. 行動の制限…？
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Limit my options...?"
msgstr ""

#. 鍵を渡せ。お前の部屋の鍵だ。
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Give me the key to your room."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>頼んでみるしかないか…
#. 霧切さんの部屋の鍵を貸してもらえるように…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have a choice. I have to see if he'll let me\n"
"borrow her room key...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
